# Dairy Factory Analytics Pipeline

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates an end-to-end data engineering and analytics pipeline built using Python and Streamlit.

The goal is to simulate a real-world manufacturing analytics solution where machine sensor data is ingested, validated, transformed, analyzed, and visualized through an interactive dashboard.

The project uses the AI4I 2020 Predictive Maintenance dataset and focuses on identifying machine failures and monitoring production performance through key performance indicators (KPIs).

---

## Business Problem

Manufacturing companies rely on machine sensor data to monitor production quality, equipment health, and operational efficiency.

This project answers questions such as:

* What is the overall machine failure rate?
* Which machine types experience the most failures?
* How does tool wear differ across machine types?
* What operational metrics should engineers monitor?

The solution provides a foundation for predictive maintenance and operational analytics.

