## How to Run

Clone repository:

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run ingestion:

```bash
python src/ingest.py
```

Run quality checks:

```bash
python src/quality_checks.py
```

Run transformations:

```bash
python src/transform.py
```

Launch dashboard:

```bash
streamlit run dashboard/app.py
```

